minimum release age features to prevent malicious packages.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"topics\">\n                    <span class=\"tag\">security</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">supply-chain</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">python</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">PyPI</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"insight-item\">\n                <div class=\"item-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Mar/24/\" class=\"accent-link\" target=\"_blank\">Streaming Experts: Running Massive LLMs on Consumer Hardware</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-author\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-source\">Simon Willison</span> <span class=\"meta-separator\">|</span> Blog <span class=\"meta-separator\">|</span> 2026-03-24\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-description\">\n                    'Streaming experts' technique allows running larger MoE models on hardware without enough RAM. Running Qwen3.5-397B in 48GB RAM, 1T parameter models on MacBook Pro.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"topics\">\n                    <span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">local-LLMs</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">Qwen</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">optimization</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"insight-item\">\n                <div class=\"item-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Mar/12/\" class=\"accent-link\" target=\"_blank\">AI-Assisted Coding Exposes Developer Divide</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-author\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-source\">Les Orchard (via Simon Willison)</span> <span class=\"meta-separator\">|</span> Blog <span class=\"meta-separator\">|</span> 2026-03-12\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-description\">\n                    AI-assisted coding revealing split between 'craft-lovers' and 'make-it-go' developers. Choice makes visible underlying motivation for why people got into programming.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"topics\">\n                    <span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">careers</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">generative-ai</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">LLMs</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"insight-item\">\n                <div class=\"item-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Mar/12/\" class=\"accent-link\" target=\"_blank\">NYT Magazine: Coding After Coders</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-author\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-source\">Clive Thompson (via Simon Willison)</span> <span class=\"meta-separator\">|</span> Blog <span class=\"meta-separator\">|</span> 2026-03-12\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-description\">\n                    Comprehensive piece interviewed 70+ developers about AI-assisted development. Programming has unique advantage: code can be tested to verify correctness.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"topics\">\n                    <span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">careers</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">generative-ai</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">press-quotes</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"insight-item\">\n                <div class=\"item-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/03/09/anthropic-launches-code-review-tool-to-check-flood-of-ai-generated-code/\" class=\"accent-link\" target=\"_blank\">Anthropic Launches Code Review Tool</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-author\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-source\">Rebecca Bellan</span> <span class=\"meta-separator\">|</span> TechMedia <span class=\"meta-separator\">|</span> 2026-03-09\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-description\">\n                    Multi-agent system automatically analyzes AI-generated code and flags logic errors. Uses multiple AI agents working in parallel, $15-25 per review on average.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"topics\">\n                    <span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">code-review</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">vibe-coding</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">multi-agent-systems</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"insight-item\">\n                <div class=\"item-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/03/24/openai-adds-open-source-tools-to-help-developers-build-for-teen-safety/\" class=\"accent-link\" target=\"_blank\">OpenAI Teen Safety Open Source Tools</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-author\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-source\">Amanda Silberling</span> <span class=\"meta-separator\">|</span> TechMedia <span class=\"meta-separator\">|</span> 2026-03-24\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-description\">\n                    Open-source prompts for making AI apps safer for teens. Addresses graphic violence, sexual content, harmful body ideals, dangerous activities, age-restricted goods.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"topics\">\n                    <span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">safety</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">teen-safety</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">open-source</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        